{"unit_id":"akshayDev17__ai-explainer-video#card-zh","repo":"akshayDev17/ai-explainer-video","commit":"b4fcffa8d542c85ca4169ca345b7999b00fe0f02","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"explainer-video 是供 DSH 加载的技能插件，会把结构化课程笔记或代码库的主要流程制作成讲解视频系列。它通过 DSH 技能文件系统注册 skills 目录，提供课程讲解和代码流程两种工作流，涵盖规划、脚本、配音、场景设计、渲染、字幕和发布素材。适合希望把课程资料整理成视频课程，或向团队解释复杂代码结构的用户。视频在本机渲染，Gemini TTS 会把旁白文本发送到 Google 服务；配音需要 Gemini API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-34","cordis.patch.yml:6-7","skills/explainer-video-from-coursework/SKILL.md:1-5","skills/explainer-video-from-codebase/SKILL.md:1-5"]}
{"unit_id":"akshayDev17__ai-explainer-video#card-en","repo":"akshayDev17/ai-explainer-video","commit":"b4fcffa8d542c85ca4169ca345b7999b00fe0f02","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"explainer-video turns coursework notes or code flows into narrated video series. It includes planning, scripting, Gemini speech, scene design, rendering, captions, and publishing workflows. Rendering is local; Gemini sends narration text to Google and needs an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-34","cordis.patch.yml:6-7","skills/explainer-video-from-coursework/SKILL.md:1-5","skills/explainer-video-from-codebase/SKILL.md:1-5"]}
