{"unit_id":"akshayDev17__ai-explainer-video#feature-1","repo":"akshayDev17/ai-explainer-video","commit":"b4fcffa8d542c85ca4169ca345b7999b00fe0f02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"explainer-video 的功能「课程笔记转视频系列」：课程工作流将笔记目录规划成视频，再逐段编写旁白、生成语音和场景，最后渲染并汇编 MP4。 通过相应工作流阶段触发，输入课程笔记或代码仓库及制作内容，产出视频系列或发布文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/explainer-video-from-coursework/tools/planner.mjs:3-18","skills/explainer-video-from-coursework/tools/assemble.mjs:3-12"]}
